 data-id=\"eedbb6c\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4dfd853\" data-id=\"4dfd853\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c92a5ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c92a5ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The solution covers all aspects of retail operations, from merchandising and inventory management to customer experience and store operations. SAP Retail Analytics and Reporting is one of the key components of this suite, and it enables retailers to gain real-time insights into their operations.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5a9a1ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5a9a1ca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>With SAP Retail Analytics and Reporting, retailers in Canada can track and analyze a wide range of data points, including sales performance, inventory levels, customer behavior, and market trends. The solution provides a range of customizable dashboards and reports that make it easy for retailers to visualize and interpret their data. The reports can be tailored to the specific needs of each retailer, providing them with the insights they need to make informed decisions.\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c7287e8\" data-id=\"c7287e8\" data-element_